WEBVTT

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.040
It's time for the main event!

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:18.250
Animal Mask vs. Macadamian Ogre, AKA, MAO!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.120
The masked wrestler, Animal Mask,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.000
will face off against former Judo fighter MAO!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.950
Will this bring an end to their long rivalry?

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.040
What kind of match do they
have in store for us tonight?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.580
It's finally time...

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:40.500
Being a pro wrestler was
the first chapter in my life.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.580
And if I can win tonight's
world championship title match,

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.290
the second chapter in my life will begin...

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.250
It's almost time for the fight!

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.370
The world championship title bout!

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.700
Big Saigo, I'm monologuing.
Don't interrupt me.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.500
Oh, I see!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.450
So, what will you do if you win tonight?

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.620
There's mountains left for you to climb!

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.910
Yes, that's exactly right.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:09.290
When I win tonight's match,
the second chapter in my life will begin.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.080
Oh, what is it?

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.790
You're quitting pro wrestling to do MMA?

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.410
No, maybe Muay Thai or Capoeira?

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:18.330
Very well. I'll tell you... I'm going to...

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:20.200
Whoops, looks like we're out of time.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.000
Break a leg and all that.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.450
Go out there and smash up
that Macadamian Ogre guy.

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:27.870
Big Saigo.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.040
He's always in a hurry.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:36.540
"No Pets!!"

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:36.540
The second chapter in my life that will begin
when I win tonight's title match...

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:40.290
Is when I will live my life
surrounded by the animals I love,

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.200
and share the joy of living with animals
with people everywhere!

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.660
"Interdimensional Title Match
Animal Mask vs MAO"

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.660
Let's go, Hiroyuki.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:56.200
The Macadamian Ogre!

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.330
And now, entering the ring...

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.580
The man who loves animals a little too much!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:09.120
Weighing in at 198 pounds, it's Animal Mask!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.950
It's finally time...

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:18.620
My rival, MAO.
A worthy opponent for my last match!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:23.870
The second chapter of my life will begin
after I slam you into the mat...

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.540
...and that is!

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.910
Opening a pet shop!

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:49.540
Strongest warrior from another world...

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:52.330
You're as strong as ever, Mao!

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.540
Impressive!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.660
However!

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:58.830
I pray you answer my call!

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:03.370
Animal Mask has climbed up onto the ropes!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.830
And now he's jumped!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.580
So has Hiroyuki!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.250
Wait! They've started to glow!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.410
What is this?

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.290
They disappeared!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.290
What is this?

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:20.750
Animal Mask has disappeared!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.200
Huh? What?

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.870
Are you the hero?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.580
I am Animal Mask!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.540
Did the hero-summoning ritual fail?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.750
Why is he in his underwear?

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.040
Is he a pervert?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.410
I don't care who you are!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:57.870
If you've answered our call,
then you are our hero!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.580
What's going on?

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.040
Another trick of Big Saigo's?

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.950
No... this isn't the arena.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.540
So where am I?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:14.250
Please, Hero, will you defeat
the evil demon beasts that stalk this land

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.830
as well as the Demon King?

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.700
Evil demon beasts?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:23.450
Yes, terrifying animals called monsters...

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.000
Exterminate every one of them
from this land...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.450
Hero?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:32.120
It appears I heard you right after all.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:37.580
You're telling me to defeat animals for you?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:41.660
Yes. They're terrifying and disgusting beasts...

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.540
Um, Hero?

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.700
We can do that after you
defeat the Demon King...

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:51.580
Or at least when nobody's watching...

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:55.910
Hero... Um, Hero?

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.870
<i>Hero</i> ?!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.500
Winner!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.910
"Wrestler x Summoning"

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.370
The princess's noble butt
is being shown to the world!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.910
Somebody, hide her butt!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.950
Defeat animals?

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.000
So the blood of an animal lover
that flows through my veins

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.750
forced me to give that impudent
girl a German suplex?

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.250
You bastard...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.830
Hero, I understand that you're angry
about being summoned like this,

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.830
but you can't do that to the princess.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:17.160
I don't know what you're talking about
with this summoning and hero nonsense!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:21.330
But... perhaps I went too far.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.830
I know!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.750
Drape.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.790
Stop messing around!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.410
Capture him!

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:40.250
Damn!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.120
I was trying to be a gentleman
and help the lady out,

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.200
why are they mad?

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.700
What kind of lunatic waves
a sword at someone like that?

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.120
This definitely isn't the arena.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.290
It's not even night anymore.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.080
Where am I?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.080
Who is that?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.160
Where are his pants?

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.660
Is he a pervert?

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.910
We should stay away...

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:08.790
He looked over here.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.200
Don't meet his gaze.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.330
Somebody go call a hunter!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.750
I guess I'll just find someone
kind-looking to ask.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.790
Um, excuse me... Can you tell me where I am?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.120
I get it!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:28.660
It's rude to ask people questions
while wearing a mask!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.620
The moment I take off my mask,
I'm no longer Animal Mask--

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.370
I'm an ordinary man named Genzo Shibata.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.250
Now no one will know...

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.200
Over there! That's him!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:44.580
--Watch out! It's a pervert!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.080
--What?
--Watch out! It's a pervert!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.500
Impossible!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.500
The pervert ran away!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.750
After the pervert!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.450
I'm not a pervert! I'm a pro wrestler!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.040
I have no idea how they figured me out.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.580
But don't worry, Hiroyuki.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.750
I'll figure out a way out of this.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.120
Sorry, Hiroyuki.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.700
Forgive me for being useless...

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:20.450
Hiroyuki! I'm so glad you're here with me!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.290
I don't know what I would've done
if I were here by myself.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.080
I don't care about clothes! Not at all!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.000
My goal is to find food for you tonight!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.500
Bro, that pervert looks pretty buff.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.660
We could sell him for a lot.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:41.540
Yes. And that strange creature
would probably be worth a lot of cash.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.000
You're so cute...

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.040
You there, in your underwear.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.950
Wh-What?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:00.000
Animal ears?!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.330
A-And...

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.370
You're hungry, right?

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.450
Come with us and we'll give you some food.

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:13.450
An animal!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:17.580
Do you like my hairy chest and tail?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.700
You've got nowhere to go, right?

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.410
Do what he says...

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:33.580
Bro, this guy seems like bad news...

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.250
Y-Yeah...

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.200
So fluffy!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.330
He's staring at you, not me!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.370
W-We'll be on our way...

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.450
What the hell?

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.620
Do you want to fight?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.580
You think you can beat a beastman
with your bare hands?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.580
Get 'em, bro!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:58.000
I see... you're a beastman, huh?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.290
Bro!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:12.120
Hey, you jerk! Get off my brother!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.410
Stop sniffing him!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.370
Misha, this guy is crazy!

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.790
He's crazy!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:23.370
We're sorry, so stop! Let him go!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.500
If you don't, my bro will... my bro will...

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.120
What's this guy's deal?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.540
He's incredibly strong!

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.540
Don't worry!
You'll start to like it any second!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.160
Oh, you like it when I rub you here, huh?

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.660
Stop it!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:43.410
We'll pay you! Stop it! Please!

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:47.120
See? Feels good, right? Good boy...

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.370
Now, you're next...

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.790
<i>Cat ears</i> !

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.790
Shigure, give up already!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.410
You're about to be sold!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.290
No!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.790
I don't want to live at some noble's house
and get walks and naps and free snacks!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.120
Who said you were being sold to a noble?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:20.120
If that was the deal I'd go myself.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.700
But if they're willing to feed me
filet mignon every day,

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.290
I may be willing to let them sell me.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:29.250
Nobody will buy a beast girl like that!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.540
Let's go!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:30.910
--No!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.750
--A poor girl in unfortunate circumstances...
--No!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.160
Stop whining and let's go!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:37.750
It's not right for an outsider
like me to get involved.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:42.370
And not because I'd rather pet the cat ears...

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.790
That tail! Those ears! Is that a wolf?

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:48.450
I've had plenty of experience touching
cats and dogs, but never a wolf!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.950
A girl with cat ears is a hard thing to pass up,

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.290
but my priority now is the wolf ears girl!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.000
Please...

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.950
All praise animal ears and animal tails!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.290
That's far enough!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.200
Mind your own business.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.700
I don't know who you think you are,

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.700
but try anything and you'll regret it.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.040
Really, who are you?

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.000
Edgar, he's dangerous!

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.540
He's a super-high-level pervert!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.950
He just had his way with my bro...

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.200
What?

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.950
What are you doing?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:22.200
Allow me to first correct
your misunderstanding.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.950
I am not a pervert.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:27.160
I simply love all animals
regardless of gender!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.250
See? He's more dangerous than he looks!

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:33.120
Yeah. The way he dresses,
the things he says...

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.910
He's a pervert like none
the world has ever seen!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.790
Why do you fear?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:43.000
I don't know who you are,
or what reasons you may have...

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.700
No! Stop it!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:49.000
If the wolf girl is upset, you are evil!

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:56.790
Damn it!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.750
You pervert! We'll get you yet!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:04.910
Come to think of it, I hadn't gotten
to pet the cat ears yet, had I?

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.450
Why did you have to open your mouth?!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.000
You're right! I'm sorry!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.330
Um...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.580
Thank you for saving me!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.080
Now I won't be sold.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.540
Don't worry. I did it because I wanted to.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.250
You were about to be kidnapped
by a slaver, right?

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:30.160
No, I'd borrowed money from him, so...

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.660
I see.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:36.040
You were charged absurd amounts of interest
and then sold to pay your debts.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:39.370
No, I'm the one who said
that if I couldn't pay by the deadline

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.330
he could sell me instead.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:46.330
In exchange, I told him to give me a loan
with no interest and no collateral,

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:51.000
and then cried and sobbed
in front of his shop until he gave in.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.830
I intended to use that money
to start a business and get rich,

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.450
but it didn't work out.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.120
She's a loser.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.580
What's that look?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.700
I was making money for a while!

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:08.200
But then humans started copying me.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.250
I am Genzo Shibata.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.700
A pro wrestler.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:16.080
My name is Shigure.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:21.450
And this is Hiroyuki. My partner
and a mongrel of pure breeding.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:25.790
Nice to meet you, too!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:30.290
Um, I'd love to thank you
for saving me, but...

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.290
I'm broke.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:36.160
But from what you said, it sounds
less like I've done a good deed

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.750
and more like I've committed a felony...

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.160
Don't worry!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:43.580
Remember what I said about
people stealing my business model?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.000
The guy who stole it was Edgar,
the guy you just saw!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.700
See? That makes him evil, right? Right? Right?

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:56.750
Well, I guess I could count that
as a good deed, just barely.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.500
So...

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.910
You said you were broke, right?

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.290
You can pay with your body instead.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.450
He's a loser.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.910
I'll get him...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.450
It's a shame, huh?

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.790
You okay?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.250
Damn that bastard.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.410
I won't just give up...

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.870
I don't think there's anything you can do.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.040
Got a plan?

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.330
Yeah. That strange creature he had.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.080
Oh, that?

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.040
What will you do with it?

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.660
What else? I'll steal it!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:48.080
Great idea! Let's do it!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.120
We're gonna do it!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:50.950
Yeah!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.830
--We'll show that pervert who's boss!

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:55.290
--I have nothing but a bad feeling...
--We'll show that pervert who's boss!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.540
So this is it?

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.500
Yes. The Hunter Guild.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:03.950
Let's work here for a while
to make some money.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.290
You seem to be really strong,

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:11.160
so there's probably lots of great jobs for you.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.120
So you see,

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:16.000
I have complete confidence
in my ability to love any animal

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:20.160
regardless of gender, species,
or even more specifically

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:25.290
hairiness, long-hair, short-hair,
eye color, or tail length!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:31.200
So I'd like to maintain a relationship of love

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:35.080
and caring with animals at all times!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:40.700
What? What is he talking about?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.250
And...

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:49.080
Even the fiercest, most violent animal will
respond to my overwhelming love for them.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.040
So...

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.120
What do I?

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:53.870
What am I supposed to do here?

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:56.910
Trouble, Guild Master!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.250
What's going on?

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.830
I'm saved!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.700
Our party was wiped out by a cerberus pack.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.910
What? Perfect.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.500
Will you go too?

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:08.500
Cerberuses are terrifying monsters...

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:09.330
What?

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.160
Where are they?

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:13.080
Genzo! Wait!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.370
What?

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:19.120
What sort of man isn't scared of a cerberus
and instead runs out to meet them?

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:22.000
What a brave man.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:26.330
But... I didn't understand
a word he was saying.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.080
It's deep in this forest!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.160
Okay!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.580
I don't think I've seen you before.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.000
Are you going unarmed?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.620
You can borrow this if you want.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.040
Fool!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.700
Do I look like a wrestler
who uses weapons to you?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.620
He's going to fight them unarmed?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:45.160
How confident is he?

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:48.080
Um, I'll borrow it...

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:51.870
Listen, we can't let them get near the town!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.700
Stop them here!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.580
This is bad!

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.160
So these are cerberuses?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.790
They've got three heads!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.370
That means triple the fun!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.410
So there are animals like this in this world?

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.870
Okay, maybe they look a little strange, but...

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.540
Are you scared?

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.450
Well, calm down.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.790
Hey!

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:24.660
No, let's see how he handles this.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.700
Yes...

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.620
Cerberus!

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.950
They appear to be a type of dog.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.870
Which means that if I can become
friends with the pack leader,

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.910
the others will quickly open up to me as well.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:44.160
The leader is probably...
the one guarding the rear!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.370
You?

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.450
<i>Hello</i> !

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.370
He ran in!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.870
Gotcha!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:52.500
He dodged them!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:58.080
Good boy! Let's play!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.950
And now for the leader!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.790
Come here!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.950
He pinned it!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.410
What kind of move is that?

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.410
But there are others...

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:21.330
This is bad!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:22.580
Should we help?

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.830
Stay out of this!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:28.160
He's keeping us out of danger?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.250
What a man!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.500
I think I'm starting to figure him out...

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.540
Good boy! Good boy!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.580
You like it here, huh?

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.660
Good boy... You're such a good boy...

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:54.160
He really pinned it with his bare hands...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.160
Like you'd pin down a lady...

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.830
He's like a lady killer...

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.120
No, he's...

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.000
...a demon beast killer!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.660
We got enough money from the job
to get you some clothes,

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.950
as well as pay for an inn for a while.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.410
Yeah.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.250
So, what will you do now?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.750
I've made my decision.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:24.040
I want people to understand
how wonderful demon beasts are!

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:26.790
Indeed! I'll bring about a world
where demon beasts and humans

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.250
can understand each other!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.910
That's impossible in this country.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:31.830
No...

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:35.950
I believe I can do it.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.120
So you must believe too.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.870
Genzo, is the reason
you refused to be a hero...?

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:49.870
That princess demanded I defeat animals!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.330
Animals and human,
beast people and humans...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.620
I like it! Let me help, too!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.250
Really? Then let's do this!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:05.120
Let's do the best with the three of us, no,
the four of us including Hiroyuki!

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:07.750
Yes!

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:08.910
Four?

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.370
Who are you?

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:49.910
Next time: "Quest x Demon Beast Killer."
